#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libxml2"
msgstr "Instalação do libxml2"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, remove an unnecessary call to <command>git</command> in "
"<filename>meson.build</filename>:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, remova uma chamada desnecessária ao <command>git</command> no "
"<filename>meson.build</filename>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:122
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed -i \"/'git'/,+3d\" meson.build</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed -i \"/'git'/,+3d\" meson.build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libxml2</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>libxml2</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:129
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -D history=enabled  \\\n"
"      -D icu=enabled      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -D history=enabled  \\\n"
"      -D icu=enabled      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to build and install the manual pages and the documentation, you"
" should have <xref linkend=\"libxslt\"/> and <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> "
"installed, and run:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja construir e instalar as páginas de manual e a documentação, "
"você deveria ter <xref linkend=\"libxslt\"/> e <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> "
"instalados e executar:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:145
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"/^dir_doc/s/\\$/ + '-' + meson.project_version()/\" \\\n"
"    -i ../meson.build                                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D docs=enabled                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"/^dir_doc/s/\\$/ + '-' + meson.project_version()/\" \\\n"
"    -i ../meson.build                                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D docs=enabled                           &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid "If you downloaded the test suite, issue the following command:"
msgstr "Se você baixou a suíte de teste, [então] emita o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:154
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar xf ../../xmlts&testsuite-version;.tar.gz -C ..</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar xf ../../xmlts&testsuite-version;.tar.gz -C ..</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests use <ulink url=\"http://localhost/\">http://localhost/</ulink> to "
"test parsing of external entities. If the machine where you run the tests "
"serves as a web site, the tests may hang, depending on the content of the "
"file served. It is therefore recommended to shut down the server during the "
"tests, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Os testes usam <ulink url=\"http://localhost/\">http://localhost/</ulink> "
"para testar a análise de entidades externas. Se a máquina onde você executar"
" os testes servir como um sítio da Web, [então] os testes possivelmente "
"travem, dependendo do conteúdo do arquivo servido. Portanto, é recomendado "
"desligar o servidor durante os testes; como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:170
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>/etc/init.d/httpd stop</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>/etc/init.d/httpd stop</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:171
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl stop httpd.service</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl stop httpd.service</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:179
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <command>xml2-config</command> may return flags needed to link against "
"the static library for the project, including the references to the <xref "
"linkend='icu'/> libraries.  That would be pointless because we only install "
"the shared library.  To make things worse, that may cause some packages "
"using <application>libxml2</application> to be unnecessarily linked against "
"some <xref linkend='icu'/> library, then those packages will need a rebuild "
"if ICU is upgraded to a new major version.  Fix this by issuing, as &root;:"
msgstr ""
"O <command>xml2-config</command> pode retornar sinalizadores necessários "
"para lincar à biblioteca estática para o projeto, incluindo as referências "
"para as bibliotecas do <xref linkend='icu'/>. Isso seria inútil, pois "
"instalamos somente a biblioteca compartilhada. Para piorar as coisas, isso "
"pode fazer com que alguns pacotes que usam a "
"<application>libxml2</application> sejam lincados desnecessariamente a "
"alguma biblioteca do <xref linkend='icu'/>, então esses pacotes precisarão "
"de uma reconstrução se o ICU for atualizado para uma nova versão principal. "
"Corrija isso executando, como &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:192
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed \"s/--static/--shared/\" -i /usr/bin/xml2-config</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed \"s/--static/--shared/\" -i /usr/bin/xml2-config</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D history=enabled</parameter>: This switch enables "
"<application>Readline</application> support when running "
"<command>xmlcatalog</command> or <command>xmllint</command> in shell mode."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D history=enabled</parameter>: Essa chave habilita o suporte "
"<application>Readline</application> ao executar "
"<command>xmlcatalog</command> ou <command>xmllint</command> no modo shell."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D icu=enabled</parameter>: This switch enables support for "
"<application>ICU</application>, which provides additional Unicode support.  "
"This is needed for some packages in BLFS, such as for QtWebEngine."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D icu=enabled</parameter>: Essa chave habilita suporte para "
"<application>ICU</application>, o qual fornece suporte adicional Unicode. "
"Isso é necessário para alguns pacotes no BLFS, como para QtWebEngine."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libxml2.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D python=enabled</option>: This switch enables the libxml2 Python "
"bindings.  Note that those bindings are deprecated due to flaws in the API "
"design and they will be removed in libxml2-2.16."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D python=enabled</option>: Essa chave habilita as vinculações "
"libxml2 para Python. Observe que essas vinculações estão obsoletas devido a "
"falhas no projeto da API e serão removidas na libxml2-2.16."

